{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["TSUKIPRO THE ANIMATION 2","For the members of SolidS, Growth, SOARA, and QUELL, the Tsukino Talent Productions' Live 2021 Summer Carnival is coming soon. The two-day event will culminate with a joint live performance featuring all four units. Due to the size and setup of the stage, each unit will need to create new songs and choreographies to accompany them in the riveting second season of TSUKIPRO THE ANIMATION.\n\n\n\n(Source: MAL Rewrite)\n\n\n\nNote: The broadcast was interrupted after the 8th episode due to COVID cases among staff members. The Season started airing again from episode 1 on October 6, 2021"],"ja":["TSUKIPRO THE ANIMATION 2",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[{"id":34474,"relation":"prequel"}],"id":"mal-37008","ids":{"shikimori":37008,"mal":37008,"anilist":125909,"kodik":"serial-36093"},"kodikIds":["serial-37329","serial-36093"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-37329":"2021-12-29T16:06:40Z","serial-36093":"2021-10-04T04:57:22Z"},"title":"Лунный проект 2","originalTitle":"TsukiPro the Animation 2","alt":"Лунный проект 2 TSUKIPRO THE ANIMATION 2 TSUKIPRO THE ANIMATION 2","description":"Участников групп SolidS, Growth, SOARA и QUELL ждёт грандиозное событие — летний карнавал Tsukino Talent Productions Live 2021. Двухдневный праздник завершится совместным выступлением всех четырёх коллективов на одной сцене. Однако размеры и особенности площадки требуют, чтобы каждая группа подготовила новые песни и хореографию специально для этого выступления — обо всём этом и пойдёт речь во втором захватывающем сезоне Лунный проект .","year":2021,"type":"TV","genres":["идолы муж","Музыка"],"rating":6.52,"popularity":1805,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[34474],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/37008/57e83d3b26e65430a2a08ec32b8cb71c.jpeg","width":685,"height":975},"backdrop":{"url":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/125909-JQDoDyobhLII.jpg","width":1900,"height":400